{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0c29aa9dc5a833d8f06","chatId":"077d26b29cb8498a83c16bdd7b5484a9","sessionId":null,"userId":98614,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1705,"promptTokens":1462,"completionTokens":146,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:30"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01098226448076098,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0c29aa9dc5a833d8f05","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482370526,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:30","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0c29aa9dc5a833d8f05","chatId":"077d26b29cb8498a83c16bdd7b5484a9","sessionId":null,"userId":98614,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n我很难与人打交道，十分厌恶社交。与他人交谈很容易让我倍感压力。今晚下班后，我独自一人看电影，度过了孤独的夜晚。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，我最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 害怕\nB) 开心\nC) 反对\nD) 绝望\nE) 悲观\nF) 伤心\n\n## 问题 2\n我为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 我喜欢远离他人的独处时光\nB) 我喜欢和工作中的同事交流\nC) 我成功完成了一项困难的工作任务\nD) 我一个人感觉非常孤独","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01098226448076098,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0c29aa9dc5a833d8f06","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482370523,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:30","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f298d37007f7407f92bbc9a547342879"}